---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Learning Hub | AuthMatrix">
  <div class="learn-hub">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Identity & Access Management Masterclass</h1>
      <p>Master OAuth 2.0, OpenID Connect, and enterprise identity standards.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="prerequisites">
      <h2>Prerequisites</h2>
      <p>Basic understanding of HTTP, APIs, and web development.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="quick-reference">
      <h2>Quick Reference</h2>
      <div class="card-grid">
        <div class="ref-card">
          <h3>AuthN vs AuthZ</h3>
          <p><strong>Authentication (AuthN):</strong> Proving <em>who</em> you are.</p>
          <p><strong>Authorization (AuthZ):</strong> Proving <em>what</em> you can do.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ref-card">
          <h3>OAuth vs OIDC</h3>
          <p><strong>OAuth 2.0:</strong> Delegated authorization framework.</p>
          <p><strong>OIDC:</strong> Identity layer on top of OAuth 2.0.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ref-card">
          <h3>Access Token vs ID Token</h3>
          <p><strong>Access Token:</strong> For the Resource Server to authorize API calls.</p>
          <p><strong>ID Token:</strong> For the Client to authenticate the user.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="curriculum">
      <h2>Curriculum</h2>
      <div class="curriculum-grid">
        <a href="/learn/oauth" class="topic-card">
          <h3>1. OAuth 2.0 Deep Dive</h3>
          <p>Understand the framework, actors, scopes, and why API keys aren't enough.</p>
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="time">⏱️ 20 min</span>
            <span class="diff beginner">Beginner</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/learn/flows" class="topic-card">
          <h3>2. Grant Types & Flows</h3>
          <p>Master the Auth Code flow, PKCE, Client Credentials, and which one to pick.</p>
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="time">⏱️ 30 min</span>
            <span class="diff intermediate">Intermediate</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/learn/oidc" class="topic-card">
          <h3>3. OpenID Connect (OIDC)</h3>
          <p>Solve the pseudo-authentication problem. ID tokens, discovery, and scopes.</p>
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="time">⏱️ 25 min</span>
            <span class="diff intermediate">Intermediate</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/learn/tokens" class="topic-card">
          <h3>4. Tokens, JWT & Claims</h3>
          <p>Deep dive into JWT structure, JWKS, token endpoints, and lifetimes.</p>
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="time">⏱️ 25 min</span>
            <span class="diff advanced">Advanced</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="references">
      <h3>Primary Sources</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6749" target="_blank">RFC 6749 (OAuth 2.0)</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7636" target="_blank">RFC 7636 (PKCE)</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7519" target="_blank">RFC 7519 (JWT)</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://openid.net/specs/openid-connect-core-1_0.html" target="_blank">OIDC Core 1.0</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc9700" target="_blank">OAuth 2.0 Security BCP</a></li>
      </ul>
    </footer>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .learn-hub {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }
  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .hero p {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  section {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .card-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .ref-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .ref-card h3 {
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .ref-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .curriculum-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .topic-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text);
    transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .topic-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--primary);
  }
  .topic-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--primary);
  }
  .topic-card p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }
  .meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .diff {
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .beginner { background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.15); color: var(--success); }
  .intermediate { background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.15); color: var(--warning); }
  .advanced { background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.15); color: var(--danger); }
  .references {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }
  .references h3 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .references ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .references li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .references a {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .references a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
